-- policy.l4
--
-- Encoding of the CODEX Insurance Limited hospitalization indemnity policy
-- (inputs/chubb-policy.txt) as an L4 `covered` predicate over the `Claim`
-- record supplied in inputs/schema.md. The DECLAREs and supporting helpers
-- immediately below are copied verbatim from that schema so this file is
-- self-contained. `covered` and its own helper functions follow.

IMPORT prelude

§ `Fact schema (verbatim from inputs/schema.md)`

DECLARE Ground IS ONE OF Sickness, `Accidental injury`, Neither

DECLARE Cause IS ONE OF
  Skydiving, `Military service`, Firefighting, `Police service`, Other

DECLARE Claim
  HAS `agreement signed`                           IS A BOOLEAN
      `premium paid month`                         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `hospitalization month`                      IS A NUMBER
      `hospitalization ground`                     IS A Ground
      `age at hospitalization`                     IS A NUMBER
      `causes`                                     IS A LIST OF Cause
      `fraud month`                                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `misrepresentation month`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit month`                       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `written confirmation month`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `dispute arisen`                             IS A BOOLEAN
      `unable to settle month`                     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `arbitration commenced month`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `valid arbitration award issued`             IS A BOOLEAN
      `written proof of claim month`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `recovery sought month`                      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `policy term months`                         IS A NUMBER

§§ `Supporting helpers (verbatim from inputs/schema.md)`

GIVEN  `event month` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
       `limit month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no later than` MEANS
  CONSIDER `event month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST m  THEN m AT MOST `limit month`

GIVEN  cs IS A LIST OF Cause
       c  IS A Cause
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arose out of` MEANS elem c cs

§ `Section 1 - Policy in Effect and Conditions`

§§ `1.3 - wellness-visit confirmation condition`

-- 1.3 requires written confirmation of a qualified wellness visit no later
-- than the 7th month anniversary, attesting to a visit that itself occurred
-- no later than the 6th month anniversary.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `wellness confirmation satisfied timely` claim IF
        `no later than` (claim's `written confirmation month`) 7
    AND `no later than` (claim's `wellness visit month`) 6
    AND claim's `wellness visit provider qualified`

-- 1.1(3): "the condition set out in Section 1.3 is still pending or has been
-- satisfied in a timely fashion" -- pending while the 7-month deadline has
-- not yet arrived as of the hospitalization; otherwise it must already have
-- been satisfied.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `condition 1.3 satisfied or still pending` claim IF
        (claim's `hospitalization month`) LESS THAN 7
    OR  `wellness confirmation satisfied timely` claim

§§ `1.2 - cancellation for fraud or misrepresentation`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `fraud or misrepresentation occurred` claim IF
    isJust (claim's `fraud month`) OR isJust (claim's `misrepresentation month`)

§§ `1.1 - policy in effect at the time of hospitalization`

-- The four numbered conditions of 1.1: signed, premium paid, 1.3
-- pending-or-satisfied, and not (otherwise) canceled. "Canceled" per 1.2
-- covers fraud/misrepresentation and automatic expiry at the end of the
-- policy term; the 1.3-lateness trigger of 1.2 is already fully captured
-- by the third conjunct above, so it is not duplicated here.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `policy in effect at hospitalization` claim IF
        claim's `agreement signed`
    AND isJust (claim's `premium paid month`)
    AND `condition 1.3 satisfied or still pending` claim
    AND NOT (`fraud or misrepresentation occurred` claim)
    AND (claim's `hospitalization month`) AT MOST (claim's `policy term months`)

-- 1.1: the benefit is premised on "the hospitalization for sickness or
-- accidental injury" -- a hospitalization on neither ground is outside the
-- scope of what this policy insures at all.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `hospitalization ground covered` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `hospitalization ground`
      WHEN Sickness            THEN TRUE
      WHEN `Accidental injury` THEN TRUE
      WHEN Neither             THEN FALSE

§ `Section 2 - General Exclusions`

-- 2.1: no benefit is paid for sickness or accidental injury arising
-- directly or indirectly out of skydiving, military service, firefighting,
-- or police service, or where the claimant's age at hospitalization is 80
-- or above.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded under general exclusions` claim IF
        `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Skydiving
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Military service`
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Firefighting
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Police service`
    OR  (claim's `age at hospitalization`) AT LEAST 80

§ `Section 3 - General Conditions`

§§ `3.2.1 - arbitration as a condition precedent to liability`

-- If a dispute has arisen, arbitration must be commenced within three
-- months of the parties becoming unable to settle, on pain of the claim
-- being extinguished; and where there is a dispute, the issuance of a valid
-- arbitration award is itself a further condition precedent to liability.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration commenced timely` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `unable to settle month`
      WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
      WHEN JUST u  THEN `no later than` (claim's `arbitration commenced month`) (u PLUS 3)

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration completed properly` claim IF
        `arbitration commenced timely` claim
    AND claim's `valid arbitration award issued`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arbitration condition satisfied` claim IF
        NOT (claim's `dispute arisen`)
    OR  `arbitration completed properly` claim

§§ `3.2.1 - sixty-day waiting period before seeking recovery`

-- "In no case shall You seek to recover on this Policy before the
-- expiration of sixty (60) days after written proof of claim has been
-- submitted" -- sixty days is approximated here as two 30-day months, to
-- match the month-denominated granularity of every other date field in
-- this schema.

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `recovery timing condition satisfied` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `recovery sought month`
      WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
      WHEN JUST r  THEN `no later than` (claim's `written proof of claim month`) (r MINUS 2)

§ `Overall coverage decision`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE covered claim IF
        `policy in effect at hospitalization` claim
    AND `hospitalization ground covered` claim
    AND NOT (`excluded under general exclusions` claim)
    AND `arbitration condition satisfied` claim
    AND `recovery timing condition satisfied` claim
